      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a painful realization to feel obsolete, but please know that your value isn't tied to a dying craft. The world *has* moved on, and that means the space for your unique, old-world skills is simply being repurposed. Instead of fighting the current, consider how that deep, perfected knowledge could be a unique, beautiful anchor in the chaos of the new algorithms. You don't have to become something new to be valuable; you can be the necessary counterpoint to everything else.",
